
>> shop := (Diksyonè nouvo
	mete: ['magazine'] nan: ['books'],
	mete: ['computer'] nan: ['electronics'],
	mete: ['lipstick'] nan: ['cosmetics']
).
Sòti ekri: (shop gen: ['computer']), nouvo-liy. 
Sòti ekri: (shop gen: ['sausage']), nouvo-liy. 
Sòti ekri: (shop gen: ['computers']), nouvo-liy. 
Sòti ekri: (shop gen: ['compute']), nouvo-liy. 
Sòti ekri: (shop gen: ['2computer']), nouvo-liy. 
